{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"b97a2197-7396-4192-8df7-755fd63ba4d9":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"11e35f63-eeb6-45f8-a306-3b7063ea7449":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_iF6ndV":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"1e5242a6-d287-4789-a7b2-aa13fc40c66a":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_xwkUJE":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"The Perfect Gifting","content":"","button_text":"","product_list":["sticky-toffee-salted-toffee-cream-bundle","vanilla-cream"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Our Sticky Toffee offers a deliciously decadent toffee flavour and mouthwatering caramel aroma. This Moonshine is absolutely transportive and will take you back to memories of your favourite classic desert and indulging in pick 'n' mix - only this time with a grown-up kick!<\/p><p>As with all our flavours, Sticky Toffee can be enjoyed neat over ice, or added to any number of drinks and cocktails. This one is particularly good as an indulgent addition to your favourite hot drinks. Alternatively create a Sticky Toffee sauce for vanilla ice cream or use this Moonshine as a boozy addition to your baking. <\/p><p>For more ideas for toffee inspired drinks, check out our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/sticky-toffee\">Sticky Toffee cocktails recipes<\/a>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, our Moonshine offers a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs, have<\/a> a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p>","page":""}},"b20024ce-a554-4583-89f3-b0fea7ae00e3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<p><strong>Sticky Toffee & Fizzy Apple<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>50ml Sticky Toffee<\/li><li>Top with Sparkling Apple Juice<\/li><li>Fresh Lime Slice<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Add Sticky Toffee to a tall glass with some ice. Top with sparkling apple and a wedge of fresh lime.<\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<strong><br\/><\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"60dedb98-e1ad-4916-ba95-e9e18097b049":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">here <\/a>to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"5502d554-8263-4a16-807b-f8fa2c4e6181":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","b97a2197-7396-4192-8df7-755fd63ba4d9","price","description","variant_picker","11e35f63-eeb6-45f8-a306-3b7063ea7449","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_iF6ndV","1e5242a6-d287-4789-a7b2-aa13fc40c66a","recommended_products_xwkUJE","collapsible-row-2","b20024ce-a554-4583-89f3-b0fea7ae00e3","collapsible-row-3","60dedb98-e1ad-4916-ba95-e9e18097b049","5502d554-8263-4a16-807b-f8fa2c4e6181","collapsible-row-0"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"c50c0b49-4bb7-4283-ba41-151fe1bd6fcb":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16302858141827__c50c0b49-4bb7-4283-ba41-151fe1bd6fcb-1685023669da0b08ab-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Award-Winning Caramel Spirit","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16302858141827__c50c0b49-4bb7-4283-ba41-151fe1bd6fcb-1685023669da0b08ab-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>One of our long-standing fan favourite flavours, Sticky Toffee has won  several awards since it joined the O'Donnell Range. Most recently, it was awarded Gold at the Spirits Business Global Liqueur Masters Awards 2024!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16302858141827__c50c0b49-4bb7-4283-ba41-151fe1bd6fcb-1685023669da0b08ab-0","template--16302858141827__c50c0b49-4bb7-4283-ba41-151fe1bd6fcb-1685023669da0b08ab-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Sticky_Toffee_1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"ef2d54e9-83a8-4a0a-ae57-604966c761ab":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16302858141827__ef2d54e9-83a8-4a0a-ae57-604966c761ab-1685023669da0b08ab-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Your Moonshine, Your Way","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16302858141827__ef2d54e9-83a8-4a0a-ae57-604966c761ab-1685023669da0b08ab-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Sticky Toffee can be enjoyed on the rocks, poured over your ice cream, or as part of a dangerously delicious <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/sticky-toffee\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/sticky-toffee\">cocktail<\/a>.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16302858141827__ef2d54e9-83a8-4a0a-ae57-604966c761ab-1685023669da0b08ab-0","template--16302858141827__ef2d54e9-83a8-4a0a-ae57-604966c761ab-1685023669da0b08ab-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_56.png","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":12,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Liquid Indulgence","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our Sticky Toffee Moonshine is created by slowly melting fine sugar into our authentic Moonshine spirit, creating a decadent flavour, tempting caramel aroma, and unbelievably smooth finish.<\/p><p>Temptingly sweet with a Moonshine kick, get ready to discover Sticky Toffee, your new favourite.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/stickytoffee3websiteimage.png","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_conte